msgid "The loop run by the agent that holds the merge-steward lane (actor merge-manager, skill merge-manager-watcher). Owner, 2026-11-02: formalise the merge manager agent's role, skills and process, and coordinate with the swarm siblings whenever a batch lands. Each wake reads the open PRs, the runner queue, main's verdict and the PR owners live, and routes to one sub-process. A wake with nothing to do ends with no message. Every merge on any route waits for the owner's own OK."
